  "note": "Complete streaming AWD/SCS reduction includes fixed XYZ f64 memory-map chunk iteration, integer classification, stable grouping, PointAccumulator allocation/update/finalization, Wasserstein and SCS index setup/destruction. Both policies contain all preceding MapEval optimizations. The control eagerly constructs an accumulator for every group; current constructs once per occupied stream cell. Updates, math, original coordinates, point order and chunk boundaries are unchanged; no generated data. Original file loading, coordinate snapshot preparation/mapping/hashing, Gaussian/update/allocation tracing and CLI writes are outside clocks. A parity pair, excluded first pair and two warm-up pairs precede five default alternating timed pairs. No observations removed. Pages are warmed; cold ingestion and peak RSS are not measured. No NN/PLY, resident-evaluation, GPU, worker-pool or persistent-cache speed claim."
